The URL belongs to the EICAR anti-malware testing environment. The detections are expected because the purpose of the resource is to test antivirus/security controls.

## 9. Key Learning

**Always investigate the purpose and context of an indicator. A malicious detection can represent a legitimate security test rather than an actual malware infection.**
